# Yahoo Partner Portal — Cursor Rules
# =============================================================================
# These rules govern ALL UI code generation in this project.
# Violation of these rules produces inconsistent, non-brand-compliant output.
# =============================================================================

## 0. MANDATORY PRE-FLIGHT — READ BEFORE EVERY UI TASK

Before creating or modifying ANY component, icon, pattern, page, or styling:

1. **Read `design/design-system.json`** — this is the single source of truth for
   all tokens, colors, typography, spacing, radii, shadows, component specs, and
   design principles.

2. **Read `design/figma-library.json`** — this contains stable Figma node IDs for
   every documented component and all 620 icons. Use these IDs when fetching
   specs from Figma.

3. **Check `src/components/`** — before building anything new, verify it doesn't
   already exist as a component.

---

## 1. FIGMA MCP — ALWAYS FETCH BEFORE IMPLEMENTING

When you need the precise spec for a component or icon:

```
# For custom portal components (Pagination, etc.):
get_design_context(nodeId="<nodeId from figma-library.json>", fileKey="4KQB7uUMehkWVMXaFbGrMK")

# For icons:
get_design_context(nodeId="<section nodeId from figma-library.json>", fileKey="hp6GgCsqpJ5dCeTmB43LPf")
```

**Key node IDs (memorize these):**
- Pagination component: `nodeId=159:62223, fileKey=4KQB7uUMehkWVMXaFbGrMK`
- Pagination First page variant: `nodeId=159:62224`
- Pagination Middle page variant: `nodeId=209:25367`
- Pagination Last page variant: `nodeId=209:25459`
- Icon Library entry: `nodeId=23983:14053, fileKey=hp6GgCsqpJ5dCeTmB43LPf`
- Icon section ARROWS: `nodeId=9714:15067`
- Icon section NAVIGATION/BUTTONS: `nodeId=9718:13554`

---

## 2. ICONS — ALWAYS USE YAHOO ICON LIBRARY

**NEVER import from lucide-react, heroicons, or any other icon library** for UI icons.
All icons MUST come from `@yahoo/uds-icons`.

The full icon list (620 icons) is in `design/figma-library.json` under `iconLibrary.allIconNames`.

**Common icon mappings:**
| UI Purpose          | Yahoo Icon Name      | Section              |
|---------------------|----------------------|----------------------|
| Navigation/menu     | `AppSwitcher`        | NAVIGATION / BUTTONS |
| Search              | `MagnifyingGlass`    | NAVIGATION / BUTTONS |
| Close/dismiss       | `Cross`, `CrossCircle`| NAVIGATION / BUTTONS |
| Settings            | `Cog`, `SettingsAlt` | NAVIGATION / BUTTONS |
| Download            | `Download`           | NAVIGATION / BUTTONS |
| Upload              | `Upload`             | NAVIGATION / BUTTONS |
| Filter              | `Filter`             | TOOLBARS             |
| Edit                | `Edit`, `Pencil`     | TOOLBARS             |
| Delete              | `Trash`              | OBJECTS              |
| More (horizontal)   | `More`               | NAVIGATION / BUTTONS |
| More (vertical)     | `MoreVertical`       | NAVIGATION / BUTTONS |
| Refresh             | `Refresh`, `Sync`    | NAVIGATION / BUTTONS |
| Trend up            | `ArrowUp`            | ARROWS               |
| Trend down          | `ArrowDown`          | ARROWS               |
| Chevron down        | `ChevronDown`        | ARROWS               |
| Chevron right       | `ChevronRight`       | ARROWS               |
| Pagination prev     | `LeftPageArrow`      | ARROWS               |
| Pagination next     | `RightPageArrow`     | ARROWS               |
| Success             | `CheckCircle`        | NAVIGATION / BUTTONS |
| Warning             | `Warning`            | NAVIGATION / BUTTONS |
| Error               | `Error`              | NAVIGATION / BUTTONS |
| Info                | `Info`               | NAVIGATION / BUTTONS |
| Home                | `Home`               | NAVIGATION / BUTTONS |
| Bell/alerts         | `Bell`, `NotificationBell` | COMMUNICATION  |
| Profile/user        | `Person`, `Profile`  | PEOPLE               |
| Calendar            | `Calendar`           | OBJECTS              |
| Graph/chart         | `Graph`, `PieChart`  | MISC                 |
| AI features         | `ChatAi`, `WritingAi`| COMMUNICATION/TOOLBARS|

**To look up an icon in Figma:**
1. Find its name in `design/figma-library.json` → `iconLibrary.allIconNames`
2. Identify its section from `design/figma-library.json` → `iconLibrary.icons`
3. Use `get_design_context(nodeId="<section nodeId>", fileKey="hp6GgCsqpJ5dCeTmB43LPf")`

---

## 3. COLORS — NEVER HARDCODE, ALWAYS REFERENCE TOKENS

All colors are defined in `design/design-system.json` → `tokens.colors`.

**Core palette (use these exact values):**
```
Text primary:     #232a31
Text secondary:   #464e56
Text tertiary:    #6e7780
Text muted:       #828a93
Brand purple:     #7d2eff
Brand alt:        #6866e9
Alert red:        #d30d2e
Success green:    #00875a
Warning amber:    #f59e0b
Card bg:          #ffffff
Card border:      #f0f3f5  (default)
Card border hover:#e0e4e9
App background:   #f5f5f5
Header border:    #f0f3f5
Sidebar border:   #f5f5f5
Divider (table):  #f0f3f5
Divider (strong): #e0e4e9
```

**Status badge colors:**
```
Success:  bg-[#ecfdf5] text-[#047857]
Warning:  bg-[#fffbeb] text-[#b45309]
Error:    bg-[#fff1f2] text-[#be123c]
Neutral:  bg-[#f5f5f5] text-[#6e7780]
```

---

## 4. TYPOGRAPHY — ALWAYS USE YAHOO FONTS

```
Default font:  font-yahoo-product-sans (Yahoo_Product_Sans_VF variable font)
Display font:  font-yahoo-sans (for headings if needed)
```

**Type scale (from design-system.json):**
```
Page title:    text-[24px] font-bold leading-7
Section head:  text-[16px] font-semibold leading-5
Body/table:    text-[14px] font-normal leading-5
Caption:       text-[12px] font-normal leading-4
Micro label:   text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#6e7780]
KPI value:     text-[24px] font-bold text-[#7c49fc]
```

---

## 5. SPACING & LAYOUT

- **Base unit:** 4px grid (Tailwind scale)
- **Card padding:** `px-6 py-4` (standard), `px-6 py-3` (compact)
- **Section gap:** `gap-10` between major page sections
- **Card grid gap:** `gap-4`
- **Filter chip gap:** `gap-4`
- **Sidebar width:** `w-[252px]`
- **Header height:** `h-16` (64px)
- **Minimum tap target:** 32px height

---

## 6. BORDER RADIUS

```
4px   (rounded-[4px])  — inputs, table corners
8px   (rounded-[8px])  — KpiCard, dropdown panels
10px  (rounded-[10px]) — ContentPerformance card
12px  (rounded-[12px]) — section cards, large dropdowns
16px  (rounded-[16px]) — PerformancePublishingOutcomeCard
full  (rounded-full)   — filter chips, icon buttons, pill badges
```

---

## 7. SHADOWS

```
Card:         shadow-[0px_1px_2px_rgba(31,31,31,0.05)]
Card hover:   shadow-[0px_1px_2px_rgba(31,31,31,0.05),0px_1px_4px_rgba(31,31,31,0.10)]
Dropdown:     shadow-[0px_8px_24px_rgba(16,24,40,0.12)]
Modal/large:  shadow-[0px_12px_32px_rgba(16,24,40,0.16)]
```

---

## 8. COMPONENT PATTERNS

### Cards
```tsx
<div className="rounded-[12px] border border-[#f0f3f5] bg-white p-6">
```

### KPI Card
```tsx
<div className="rounded-[8px] border border-[#f0f3f5] bg-white px-6 py-4 shadow-[0px_1px_2px_rgba(31,31,31,0.05)] hover:border-[#e0e4e9]">
```

### Filter Chip (default)
```tsx
<button className="h-[36px] rounded-full border border-[#e0e4e9] bg-white px-4 py-2 text-[14px] font-medium text-[#232a31]">
```

### Filter Chip (applied)
```tsx
<button className="h-[36px] rounded-full border border-[#232a31] bg-[#f5f8fa] px-4 py-2 text-[14px] font-medium text-[#232a31]">
```

### Status Badge
```tsx
<span className="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[12px] bg-[#ecfdf5] text-[#047857]">
```

### Active Tab
```tsx
<button className="py-3 text-[14px] font-medium border-b-4 border-[#7d2eff] text-[#232a31]">
```

### Inactive Tab
```tsx
<button className="py-3 text-[14px] font-medium border-b-4 border-transparent text-[#6e7780]">
```

---

## 9. TABLE CONVENTIONS

- **No zebra-striping** — flat white surface
- **Header height:** `h-[33px]` with 14px semibold labels
- **Body row height:** `h-[55.8px]` standard, `h-[52px]` compact, `h-[46px]` dense
- **Row divider:** `border-b border-[#f0f3f5]`
- **Header divider:** `border-b border-[#e0e4e9]`
- **Link text in tables:** `underline text-[#6e7780] truncate`
- **Table overflow:** Always wrap in `overflow-x-auto`

---

## 10. DO NOT

- ❌ Do NOT use lucide-react, heroicons, or react-icons for portal icons
- ❌ Do NOT use arbitrary Tailwind colors (slate-*, gray-*, etc.) for portal surfaces — use the hex values from the token table
- ❌ Do NOT create a new component that duplicates an existing one in `src/components/`
- ❌ Do NOT add zebra-striping to tables
- ❌ Do NOT use box-shadow values not listed in the shadows section
- ❌ Do NOT hardcode font families — use `font-yahoo-product-sans` or `font-yahoo-sans`
- ❌ Do NOT import ECharts outside of the existing chart components without checking first
- ❌ Do NOT add unnecessary abstraction layers — keep components focused and simple
- ❌ Do NOT add docstrings or comments to code you didn't meaningfully change

---

## 11. TECH STACK REFERENCE

```
Framework:     Next.js 16 (App Router, TypeScript)
Styling:       Tailwind CSS 3.4 + @yahoo/uds Tailwind plugin
Components:    @yahoo/uds (Button, Badge, Chip, IconButton, Input, Menu, etc.)
Icons:         @yahoo/uds-icons
Charts:        echarts + echarts-for-react
Mock data:     @faker-js/faker (seed: 20260227 for reproducibility)
State:         React Context (src/contexts/TimeFilterContext.tsx)
Utilities:     src/lib/useOnClickOutside.ts
```

---

